{"anomaly_threshold":50,"author":["Elastic"],"description":"机器学习：检测Windows主机罕见进程。对应需求：Windows主机异常。官方：Unusual Process For a Windows Host。","false_positives":["合法变更窗口内的运维、发布或新业务上线","基线学习期的机器学习误报"],"from":"now-6h","interval":"15m","license":"Elastic License v2","machine_learning_job_id":["v3_rare_process_by_host_windows_ea"],"name":"【默认】Windows主机罕见进程（机器学习）","note":"## 调查指引\n\n### 规则说明\nWindows主机罕见进程\n\n### 为何重要\n相对 Windows 主机基线出现罕见进程、脚本或服务行为\n\n### 调查步骤\n1. 核对告警实体、时间窗与是否处于 ML 基线学习期。\n2. 核对关联主机、用户、进程或网络目的是否符合变更窗口。\n3. 关联同实体前后同类告警与落地文件/外连。\n\n### 常见误报\n- 合法变更窗口内的运维、发布或新业务上线\n- 机器学习基线尚未稳定\n\n### 响应建议\n1. 确认是否授权与变更窗口。\n2. 无授权则隔离主机或账号，并排查持久化与外连。\n3. 按主机与用户关联前后同类告警。\n","references":["https://www.elastic.co/guide/en/security/current/prebuilt-ml-jobs.html"],"risk_score":21,"rule_id":"6d448b96-c922-4adb-b51c-b767f1ea5b76","setup":"## 设置说明\n\n1. 目标 Windows 主机安装 Elastic Agent，启用 **Elastic Defend**（按规则需要进程/网络/安全日志）。\n2. 关联的机器学习 job 成功启动后再评估告警。\n3. 确认相关数据流有数据后再启用。\n","severity":"low","tags":["操作系统: Windows","主题: 主机安全","来源: 默认","规则类型: 机器学习","对应需求: Windows主机异常"],"type":"machine_learning","threat":[{"framework":"MITRE ATT&CK","technique":[{"id":"T1543","name":"Create or Modify System Process","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1543/","subtechnique":[{"id":"T1543.003","name":"Windows Service","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1543/003/"}]}],"tactic":{"id":"TA0003","name":"Persistence","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/tactics/TA0003/"}},{"framework":"MITRE ATT&CK","technique":[{"id":"T1569","name":"System Services","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1569/","subtechnique":[{"id":"T1569.002","name":"Service Execution","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1569/002/"}]}],"tactic":{"id":"TA0002","name":"Execution","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/tactics/TA0002/"}}],"related_integrations":[{"package":"endpoint","version":"*"},{"package":"windows","version":"*"}],"investigation_fields":{"field_names":["host.name","user.name"